022</b></span></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<b> 24/12/2022 </b></li>\n<li>Office Attendant Mains Exam Date : <b>26/05/2026<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available : <b>14/05/2026<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>Office Attendant Mains Answer Key :<strong> 04/06/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"393\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS : <b>540/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH : <b>135/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking Mode Only. <b> </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"792\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>BSSC Senior Scientist Assistant 2022 </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Age Limit as on 01/01/2022</b></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>21 Years. &nbsp;</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>37 Years</b>. for Male</li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>40 Years</b>. for Female</li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per BSSC Senior Scientist Assistant Vacancy 2022 Recruitment Rules<b>. </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"792\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Bihar SSC Senior Scientist Assistant Recruitment 2022</b><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b> Vacancy Details Total : 100 Post</b></span></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"210\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Exam Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"464\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>BSSC Senior Scientist Assistant Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"210\">\n<p align=\"center\">BSSC Senior Scientist Assistant</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\n<p align=\"center\">100</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"464\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree / Master Degree in Related Post / Trade in Any Recognized University in India.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"792\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>BSSC Senior Scientist Assistant Notification 2022<span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"> Category</span></b><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"> Wise </span><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Vacancy Details<br>\n</span></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"174\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>General (UR)</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"83\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>EWS</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>BC</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"83\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>EBC</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>BC Female</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"91\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>SC</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"72\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>ST</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"77\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"174\">43</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"83\">\n<p align=\"center\">08</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"95\">\n<p align=\"center\">10</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"83\">\n<p align=\"center\">18</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"118\">\n<p align=\"center\">02</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"91\">\n<p align=\"center\">18</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"72\">\n<p align=\"center\">01</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"77\">\n<p align=\"center\">100</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"792\"><center><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>How to Fill BSSC Senior Scientist Assistant Exam 2022 Online Form<br>\n</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bihar Staff Selection Commission BSSC 3rd Graduate Level Combined Competitive Exam Various Post &nbsp;Recruitment 2022. Candidate Can Apply Between <b>14 April 2022 to 17 May 2022.</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Bihar SSC Latest Jobs 2022.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"792\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"345\">\n\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"447\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"792\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Office Attendant </b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Mains Answer Key</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"BSSC SET A Answer Key\" href=\"https://bssc.bihar.gov.in/Advertisement/02_2022_main_set_A.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Set A</a>, <a title=\"BSSC SET B\" href=\"https://bssc.bihar.gov.in/Advertisement/02_2022_main_set_B.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Set B</a>, <a title=\"BSSC SET C\" href=\"https://bssc.bihar.gov.in/Advertisement/02_2022_main_set_C.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Set C</a>, <a title=\"BSSC SET D\" href=\"https://bssc.bihar.gov.in/Advertisement/02_2022_main_set_D.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Set D</a></b></h2>\n</td>\n<